Package: opentargetfolder
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: open-target-folder Tracker add-on for V\OS
 OpenTargetFolder adds a right-click Tracker action that opens, in a
 Tracker window, the folder the target of a selected symbolic link
 lives in.
